{
"file": 41,
"paths": [
"d002/f661"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "fca79f83",
"en_raw": "What's a will-o'-the-wisp?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "acaa0b09",
"en_raw": "Kurumi doesn't know"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "8e461ab0",
"en_raw": "...The soul of a dead person"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "a026712a",
"en_raw": "appearing in the shape of a flame"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "49e920a4",
"en_raw": "No, it's plasma, right?"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "9887677c",
"en_raw": "There was that theory too"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "6bbe2900",
"en_raw": "Earlier still, there was a theory"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "46bba24f",
"en_raw": "that phosphorus from corpses in graves"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "f86fd33c",
"en_raw": "on rainy days burned"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "826352bf",
"en_raw": "and floated in the air"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "0738d467",
"en_raw": "Apparently a lie, though"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "8125ddbe",
"en_raw": "So what is a will-o'-the-wisp, anyway?"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "dd1135f2",
"en_raw": "Whatever"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "069eadaf",
"en_raw": "These days people have"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "b51ec74b",
"en_raw": "given up on scientific verification"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "6f666115",
"en_raw": "And image-wise"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "7ebcfd4d",
"en_raw": "will-o'-the-wisps are kind of retro"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "aacd5eba",
"en_raw": "The era of ghosts"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "5098140d",
"en_raw": "with wisps is over"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "eb659cbf",
"en_raw": "But they say wisps appeared"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "d5596900",
"en_raw": "in Hirumi too"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "1fd95108",
"en_raw": "...at three places, no less"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "d4686e08",
"en_raw": "So?"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "3ac50e5f",
"en_raw": "The sighting spots line up in a row"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "5d1987e0",
"en_raw": "and that's a sign"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "a85fabff",
"en_raw": "of something amazing"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "eeeb244f",
"en_raw": "Hmm, what amazing thing?"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "792e42f3",
"en_raw": "Anyway, something amazing"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "ae67e811",
"en_raw": "How should I put it, in Kume's terms..."
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "663b70ca",
"en_raw": "Kojiro Kume yet again"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "e9199ed5",
"en_raw": "But that might be interesting"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "f85a80ad",
"en_raw": "So where are the key sighting spots?"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "91a37bcf",
"en_raw": "The Wildflower Garden, the reservoir, and..."
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "c54750ed",
"en_raw": "one more, I think..."
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "a9c2f60d",
"en_raw": "The Wildflower Garden, the reservoir"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "c45657ab",
"en_raw": "both are far"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "a14a4034",
"en_raw": "but let's go wisp-watching"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "cab81332",
"en_raw": "Sighting spots in a straight line"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "2aad2e65",
"en_raw": "For now, shall we head to the"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "a7d0183b",
"en_raw": "reservoir and the garden?"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "efe7f2b3",
"en_raw": "If we go to the pond, there are turtles"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "ec0c3aa4",
"en_raw": "If we enter the forest, early is better"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "b47ad26a",
"en_raw": "There are lots of scary rumors"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "a6a84753",
"en_raw": "about there, Nao"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "ebb70875",
"en_raw": "No, it's because you get lost when it's dark"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "15b265e2",
"en_raw": "If it doesn't get dark, we"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "98755b32",
"en_raw": "can't see a wisp"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "0566c91e",
"en_raw": "That wasn't"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "27286a32",
"en_raw": "a wisp, was it?"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "b366d20b",
"en_raw": "...I mean"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "b381971f",
"en_raw": "Who on earth is the coward"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "7a685206",
"en_raw": "that mistook it?"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "d1873a88",
"en_raw": "But Kurumi saw something nice"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "33f7ebc3",
"en_raw": "Kurumi will tell Kou-kun"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "96408b16",
"en_raw": "about that bug too"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "25f80c18",
"en_raw": "Come on, next place"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "efd7069a",
"en_raw": "Next is... the Wildflower Garden, right?"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "9856f406",
"en_raw": "Nao, was that real?"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "450e67a8",
"en_raw": "No doubt..."
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "b4a39b0d",
"en_raw": "Then why"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "cc066f4b",
"en_raw": "would it appear in a place like that?"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "d1e3c2f1",
"en_raw": "Maybe the garden used to be a graveyard..."
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "2c7a618a",
"en_raw": "Really?"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "b43637f3",
"en_raw": "Kurumi knows that smell"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "c8b6f594",
"en_raw": "Melos said woof"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "c0c72407",
"en_raw": "and it ran away"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "b7577d57",
"en_raw": "I smelled something, and it was"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "333a26dc",
"en_raw": "the alien old man"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "c2f51e8a",
"en_raw": "It wasn't a wisp"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "5e8f425b",
"en_raw": "Still communicating as ever"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "0f9a34d1",
"en_raw": "He'll be kicked out"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "1a3ee732",
"en_raw": "by the city hall people soon"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "caab962e",
"en_raw": "He didn't seem to remember"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "f033f7be",
"en_raw": "Shiina"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "2b53c24e",
"en_raw": "Ah, Princess Bon"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "ade2e6a0",
"en_raw": "It's good he forgot"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "40a69399",
"en_raw": "Now there's no worry"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "d669cb96",
"en_raw": "of being stalked"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "e484a8a6",
"en_raw": "Kurumi was a little"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "475fc184",
"en_raw": "sad"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "1a196867",
"en_raw": "Well, whatever, next sighting spot?"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "8c052ebe",
"en_raw": "The reservoir, I guess..."
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "8574a4b4",
"en_raw": "The reservoir, huh..."
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "512e65e7",
"en_raw": "Maybe this time we'll meet"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "90b1e0ca",
"en_raw": "a real wisp..."
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "54b6151f",
"en_raw": "But if we actually met one"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "906b2953",
"en_raw": "What are you going to do?"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "7b68d933",
"en_raw": "Ah, that was fun"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "79ef1420",
"en_raw": "So the rumor is solved"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "cdd35de9",
"en_raw": "Just in case"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "0df5d5fa",
"en_raw": "there's one more spot, but..."
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "42a0681a",
"en_raw": "Enough already"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "8f2c6e5a",
"en_raw": "I mean"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "f4f7f929",
"en_raw": "what can you believe from people"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "b141d95a",
"en_raw": "who call fireflies and torches"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "70a97b2a",
"en_raw": "wisps?"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "f0bb02e6",
"en_raw": "I'm just worn out"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "1244bc15",
"en_raw": "someone take responsibility..."
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "46fbb9b6",
"en_raw": "Kurumi had fun with the wisps"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "d91733d8",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to see more"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "b46944bd",
"en_raw": "So, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "0716e047",
"en_raw": "a will-o'-the-wisp"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "60c3f928",
"en_raw": "is a bizarre paranormal phenomenon"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "ea85526d",
"en_raw": "not silly stuff like this"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "ead592b1",
"en_raw": "Shiina, I remembered"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "7ac6fac4",
"en_raw": "The third sighting spot is..."
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "68a815c5",
"en_raw": "midway between the reservoir"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "571642db",
"en_raw": "and the garden, with a good view of the sky"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "2661a5b0",
"en_raw": "Kurumi doesn't get it"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "2d670bd6",
"en_raw": "You'd know right away from a map"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "1b55de45",
"en_raw": "Hey, let's go there now"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "bbc83771",
"en_raw": "Kume said"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "a3576a10",
"en_raw": "the three sighting spots"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "2f86e979",
"en_raw": "line up in a straight line"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "1681d0c1",
"en_raw": "Around the middle of the reservoir and garden"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "4f12ae26",
"en_raw": "right at the top of the slope"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "59dd8a8e",
"en_raw": "What straight line?"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "1af8cee4",
"en_raw": "Two spots are crossed out"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "74b89c98",
"en_raw": "so it doesn't hold up already"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "d001f03f",
"en_raw": "That was an amazing wisp"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "b7789a55",
"en_raw": "Right, right, Sango?"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "fb77d15b",
"en_raw": "I told you, that wasn't a wisp"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "26eb76e3",
"en_raw": "it was a UFO"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "47876ae4",
"en_raw": "A UFO?"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "2f6f2146",
"en_raw": "What's a UFO?"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "fb35b86b",
"en_raw": "What, that thing"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "b9a0b6aa",
"en_raw": "...An optical illusion from outer space"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "8dff9ebe",
"en_raw": "Well then"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "e8ac3d4d",
"en_raw": "the Kapukapu old man"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "18e426f7",
"en_raw": "got his signal through!"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "fe68a91c",
"en_raw": "Yeah, yeah..."
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "353b5ed2",
"en_raw": "Yay!"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "14b90c9b",
"en_raw": "And so, the wisp story"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "e3f8a22f",
"en_raw": "is really over now"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "068ffbd9",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Will-o'-the-Wisp"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "a15d02d5",
"en_raw": "It was a strange affair, but"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "9d9064dc",
"en_raw": "I'll keep this story"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "9ff7c701",
"en_raw": "from Kume"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "a44d22bf",
"en_raw": "He'd probably get depressed..."
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}